data: {"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":43,"result":{"id":"f33d3fe8-6aea-49c7-924b-2ac060dde044","kind":"task","contextId":"thr_a0a48e0b-a991-40d6-aede-83ca4752c799","status":{"state":"Completed","timestamp":"2025-10-10T22:39:22.858Z"},"history":[{"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"Top 4 beaches in CA?"}],"max_completion_tokens":1800,"user":"user-rapid7","stream":true,"stream_options":{"include_usage":true},"temperature":0.1,"top_p":0.1,"presence_penalty":0,"frequency_penalty":0}],"artifacts":[{"kind":"artifact","artifactId":"8d4e729b-257e-46f4-bec3-aa7a0fe6cadb","parts":[{"kind":"text","text":"California is famous for its beautiful coastline and stunning beaches. Here are four of the top beaches in California, known for their scenery, activities, and popularity:\n\n1. **Santa Monica Beach** (Santa Monica)  \n   - Iconic beach with a lively pier featuring an amusement park, aquarium, and restaurants.  \n   - Great for swimming, sunbathing, volleyball, and biking along the beachfront path.  \n   - Close to shops and dining in Santa Monica.\n\n2. **Laguna Beach** (Orange County)  \n   - Known for its picturesque coves, tide pools, and art galleries.  \n   - Excellent for snorkeling, scuba diving, and exploring tide pools.  \n   - Quaint town with a vibrant arts scene and beautiful coastal views.\n\n3. **La Jolla Shores** (San Diego)  \n   - Family-friendly beach with gentle waves, perfect for kayaking, paddleboarding, and beginner surfing.  \n   - Adjacent to the La Jolla Underwater Park, great for snorkeling and diving.  \n   - Scenic cliffs and nearby restaurants.\n\n4. **Pfeiffer Beach** (Big Sur)  \n   - Famous for its dramatic purple sand and unique rock formations, including Keyhole Rock.  \n   - More secluded and less crowded, offering a peaceful and scenic experience.  \n   - Ideal for photography and enjoying the rugged beauty of Big Sur.\n\nEach of these beaches offers a unique experience, from bustling boardwalks to tranquil natural beauty."}],"name":"Application Response","description":"Response from AI App inference pipeline","metadata":{}}],"metadata":{"requestId":"req_f6ca66ff-6582-422f-a3a4-8084fe9ae67e","cached":true}}}

